    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/f95efe961c2bda6e930ea27ffc5ba844.poster.avif?t=1752266278\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/f95efe961c2bda6e930ea27ffc5ba844.webm?t=1752266278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/f95efe961c2bda6e930ea27ffc5ba844.mp4?t=1752266278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/d7dd94de274cb6781110067557b2130b.webp?t=1752266278\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sundowner is a PvP survival game. Start on an island with limited resources and gather up the basic resources for survival. While you are doing that, the others on the island are doing the same, so watch out, arm yourself with whatever you have and defend yourself from the other players!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Procedural island generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Progression through crafting and base building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Realism-based bullet mechanics and features</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Physically-based tools, body, and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Play against 20 other players on official and any amount of players on community-hosted servers </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/5894a22502aa85d68199a4bb2cdec37c.avif?t=1752266278\" data-has-big /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/303d42a3c549dabd3f8056bcff9cb2a4.avif?t=1752266278\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedural generation can create dense forests and spawns structures that deform the terrain mesh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/ac1ecdb744b7552842fda12ebbc3fbba.avif?t=1752266278\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LOD Grass Shader Optimization. Allows for performant dense grass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/8011cb0409c94760659b433f2fc571b8.avif?t=1752266278\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/ee651cceb037f21e38fd128e5d4ff6c0.avif?t=1752266278\" /></div>Loading a chamber</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/2258bf2b7f81e821bc42c03a5bd6424e.avif?t=1752266278\" data-has-big /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/662814ed856d3d9a7c2a033864b4a486.avif?t=1752266278\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bullets can be seen inside the magazine and can be loaded with mixed ammunition\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/f95efe961c2bda6e930ea27ffc5ba844.poster.avif?t=1752266278\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/f95efe961c2bda6e930ea27ffc5ba844.webm?t=1752266278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/f95efe961c2bda6e930ea27ffc5ba844.mp4?t=1752266278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/d7dd94de274cb6781110067557b2130b.webp?t=1752266278\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sundowner is a PvP survival game. Start on an island with limited resources and gather up the basic resources for survival. While you are doing that, the others on the island are doing the same, so watch out, arm yourself with whatever you have and defend yourself from the other players!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Procedural island generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Progression through crafting and base building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Realism-based bullet mechanics and features</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Physically-based tools, body, and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Play against 20 other players on official and any amount of players on community-hosted servers </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/5894a22502aa85d68199a4bb2cdec37c.avif?t=1752266278\" data-has-big /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/303d42a3c549dabd3f8056bcff9cb2a4.avif?t=1752266278\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedural generation can create dense forests and spawns structures that deform the terrain mesh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/ac1ecdb744b7552842fda12ebbc3fbba.avif?t=1752266278\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LOD Grass Shader Optimization. Allows for performant dense grass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/8011cb0409c94760659b433f2fc571b8.avif?t=1752266278\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/ee651cceb037f21e38fd128e5d4ff6c0.avif?t=1752266278\" /></div>Loading a chamber</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/2258bf2b7f81e821bc42c03a5bd6424e.avif?t=1752266278\" data-has-big /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644230/extras/662814ed856d3d9a7c2a033864b4a486.avif?t=1752266278\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bullets can be seen inside the magazine and can be loaded with mixed ammunition\u00a0</p>",
